title: "fpga-sim-core"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic C++20 cycle model of a tick-to-trade datapath, driven by a
  synthetic ITCH 5.0 stream. Reported latencies are simulated-cycle counts,
  not hardware measurements.
type: software
